Derived at upstream commit 48eef5bd (ntex 4.0.0-beta.2).

The following modules are ports of ntex code, with directory layout and
crate paths adapted to geario-http. Code logic is unchanged:

  geario-http/src/types/    from ntex-http
  geario-http/src/          from ntex/src/http
  geario-http/src/h1/       from ntex/src/http/h1
  geario-http/src/client/   from ntex/src/client

HTTP/2 was not ported; ntex routes it through the separate ntex-h2 crate.
